commit 262f6fefc40b579dfb9c35e56b3dc11a7d579f79
Author: Michael Still <mikal@stillhq.com>
Date:   Sat Oct 24 09:50:39 2026 +1100

    Load the DB API only for DB users
    
    neutron_lib imports neutron_lib.db.api so that its ORM listeners exist
    before any model class (bug 1802369), loading pecan into every agent.
    Have model_base import it and register the BASEV2 listener itself, and
    import it lazily elsewhere, so listeners register on first DB use.
    
    neutron_lib.context and agent.topics now add 35.6MB, not 42.9MB, but
    agents gain nothing until neutron's common/utils, service, api_common,
    common/ovn/utils, ovsdb_monitor, agent/rpc and stdattrs_common follow.
    SQLAlchemy and oslo.db still load through context's enginefacade.
    
    Prompt: Mikal asked for import-memory fixes that can be landed one at a
    time and measured in devstack CI; neutron-lib's DB API was the first
    importer of the database stack in every neutron agent.
    
    Assisted-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (high effort)
    
    Depends-On: https://review.opendev.org/c/openstack/devstack/+/1011992
    Change-Id: I18e81a68cc7a6fe513992b1e8fdc5e75c8615944
    Signed-off-by: Michael Still <mikal@stillhq.com>

